er-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Set</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"set pieces\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Set Pieces</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Odin_Set\" title=\"Odin Set\">Odin Set</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Cape of Odin</b> is a DLC armor piece. It is only available for the early supporters of <i>Valheim</i> via a Steam code sent out in an email from Iron Gate Studios to those who signed up for the <i>Valheim Beta</i>. Check your email if you signed up!\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The crafting recipe is unlocked once the player has discovered <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>. The Cape of Odin is crafted at the <a href=\"/wiki/Workbench\" title=\"Workbench\">Workbench</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_information\">Upgrade information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCape_of_Odin%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Quality\n</th>\n<th>1\n</th>\n<th>2\n</th>\n<th>3\n</th>\n<th>4\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Durability\n</th>\n<td>1500\n</td>\n<td>1550\n</td>\n<td>1600\n</td>\n<td>1650\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Armor\n</th>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Crafting recipe\n</th>\n<td>10 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a><br />4 <a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>\n</td>\n<td>5 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a><br />2 <a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>\n</td>\n<td>10 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a><br />4 <a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>\n</td>\n<td>15 <a href=\"/wiki/Leather_scraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather scraps\">Leather scraps</a><br />6 <a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\">Workbench level\n</th>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCape_of_Odin%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The cape and <a href=\"/wiki/Hood_of_Odin\" title=\"Hood of Odin\">hood</a> can be spawned via commands, but cannot be equipped or upgraded without the DLC.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"S